WEBVTT

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.020
Here they come.

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:07.900
These are the tsukumogami from Mayoiga...

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.630
We'll take the man in the motorcycle jacket.

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:12.930
That leaves tubby and the beanpole for me.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.260
And we take the woman.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.210
Okay!

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:26.720
Stay out of this, Akito.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.420
They already know you're 
from Mayoiga, don't they?

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.640
It's not the right time yet.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.180
Stay away from the regional god.

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:40.680
Do you know how many of our comrades 
have died waiting for "the right time"?!

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:43.940
I'm sorry.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.940
I never liked you, anyway.

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:57.450
The feeling's mutual.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.330
<b>Kanayama
Hexagonal
Adamantine
Pillar</b>

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:06.410
What the?!

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:07.370
A barrier?

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:08.260
Right.

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:12.090
And no one will get in the way here.

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:14.580
Now, let's enjoy ourselves.

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:21.220
Kazuya! What's wrong?!

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:26.600
Seriously? This is pathetic.

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:33.860
<b>Tremor Tone Flute: Sound Wall</b>

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:33.860
Tremor Tone Flute: Sound Wall!

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:38.090
My Tremor Tone Flute has no weaknesses.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:40.280
If this is all her malison exorcist can do,

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:42.200
this region's goddess won't be any trouble.

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:07.060
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:07.060
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:18.470
m 0 0 l 0 -10 l 10 -10 l 10 0

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:18.470
m 0 0 l 0 -10 l 10 -10 l 10 0

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:18.470
<b>Chapter 9</b>

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:18.460
<b>Assassins</b>

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.010
"Assassins."

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:31.270
Need any help, Akito?

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:37.890
That won't be necessary.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:44.910
I guess training with Mayoiga's strongest 
fighter makes a difference after all.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.100
Nice, Akito!

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:50.910
I've never landed a single 
hit on Chikage, though.

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:54.380
You think this is gonna be easy?

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.780
Don't take it personally, Akito!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:57.940
<b>Axe</b>

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:58.170
Battle Axe:

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:00.800
<b>Divide</b>

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:00.800
Divide!

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.810
Battle Axe: Shave!

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:09.810
<b>Shave</b>

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.560
Battle Axe: Reform!

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.560
<b>Reform</b>

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:17.580
<i>There was nothing there, 
but I was still slashed!</i>

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:18.820
Akito!

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:22.300
I'm dominating him! I've got this!

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:28.200
When did he cut me?

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:32.280
Take your friends and go back to Mayoiga.

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:35.210
Or it'll be more than a 
flesh wound next time.

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:39.130
You never cease pissing me off.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:43.220
But I'm not about to back down!

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:52.180
<i>He blocked with one arm? Wait...</i>

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:57.480
My body...

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.660
That's a scissors case.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:00.830
That's right.

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:05.160
Tsukumogami like us are bound by the 
logic of the items from which we are born.

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:10.120
Now, you're done, Akito!

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:13.970
Adamantine Column!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.370
<b>Kanayama Hexagonal Adamantine Pillar</b>

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:19.100
<b>Heavenly Defense: Risen Shield</b>

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:19.530
Heavenly Defense: Risen Shield!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.880
<b>Fighting Fans: Fan Dance</b>

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:24.880
Fighting Fans: Fan Dance!

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.130
Adamantine Coins!

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.390
You're wasting your time!

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:33.660
Fighting Fans: Scattered Flowers!

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:36.390
Adamantine Column, protect me!

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:39.600
Heavenly Defense: Shield Opening!

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:47.260
<b>Kanayama Hexagonal Adamantine Pillar</b>

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:48.790
Fool.

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:53.450
You must've underestimated us, 
thinking we're ordinary tsukumogami.

00:05:54.860 --> 00:06:00.040
A tsukumogami's power gains more breadth and becomes more vast the older they get.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:05.800
We've got powers that rival 
those of your average deity.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:15.310
I missed? Lucky for you.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:20.330
We can't get closer at this rate. 
We need to back away for now.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:23.450
Kazuya?!

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:25.150
Woven Legs!

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:30.950
Tremor Tone Flute: Hammering Pipe Note!

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:35.700
You're finished!

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:36.700
I don't think so!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:38.160
Shield Weave!

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:46.060
Invisible shock waves... What do we do?

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:47.880
Kiriha-san...

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.010
Let's use Divine Possession.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:54.270
We have to beat her!

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:55.850
What are you saying, you imbecile?!

00:06:55.850 --> 00:07:00.100
What if Divine Possession runs out 
before we find a way to take her down?

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:03.290
You usually fight smarter than this!

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.470
It's not like you to lose your head in a rage!

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:08.390
But she...

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:11.500
Aw, done already?

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:16.620
I have to say, the crow priestess 
put up a much better fight.

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:18.400
What?

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:20.080
It was a fierce fight,

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.820
but she remained at a safe distance 
while throwing out sharp attacks...

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:29.630
That said, she was completely outnumbered, 
so all she could really do was run.

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:37.390
And that's why, whenever I saw an opening, 
I shattered the smaller bones in her body.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:41.890
One at a time... bit by bit.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:47.040
That cool look on her face 
started to warp in agony...

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:50.260
And before long, she couldn't 
choke back her anguished moans.

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:54.120
But I'm not satisfied in the least.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:58.810
I need to hear the melody of my 
prey's last cries before dying...

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:05.170
So I need to make sure 
I finish the crow off.

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:10.950
And when I get to this region's goddess, 
I'll spend twice the time...

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:13.180
I mean, the death of a god?

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:16.170
That's the kind of sound you'd be 
lucky to hear once in a lifetime!

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:22.680
I'm really looking forward to it.

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:24.430
You wretch!

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:25.600
Ayasakura.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:27.940
Divine Possession.

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:31.940
No way...

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:34.480
Divine Possession?!

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:38.700
When a master and their tsukumogami unite 
as one... I've never seen it before!

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.970
<i>Kazuya commanded me?</i>

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:44.460
<i>With my real name, so I couldn't refuse?</i>

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:48.760
High Impact Note: Four Part Harmony!

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:54.280
Hammering Pipe Note!

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:56.890
Obi Drum!

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.640
<i>He canceled it out with a lower tone?!</i>

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:04.220
<i>I won't be able to defend in time.</i>

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:05.890
<i>In that case...</i>

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:08.810
Tremor Tone Flute, Final Technique:

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:15.570
<b>Eight Grand High Pitch Impacts</b>

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:12.460
Eight Grand...

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:15.140
High Pitch Impacts!

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:19.580
Yes!

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:24.580
Rest in pieces, malison exorcist!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:31.090
<b>Sound-Proof Shield Weave</b>

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:31.090
Sound-Proof Shield Weave.

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:32.840
It can't be...

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:39.000
W-Wait...

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:41.930
Don't, Kazuya! Don't kill her!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:44.100
Coiling Serpent!

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:03.490
You stopped short...

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:09.240
That was easy. 
So much for this resident goddess.

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:12.520
Well, that just leaves the 
one in charge of this region.

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:13.440
Right.

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:14.530
True enough...

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:20.260
You Mayoiga tsukumogami 
shouldn't be underestimated.

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:23.730
Scattered Flowers hit her dead-on!

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:26.140
Did it not affect her?!

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:31.520
Oh, you'll need more than 
that to get through to me.

00:10:32.850 --> 00:10:33.520
Now, then...

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:38.780
I've got an idea of your power, 
so it's time to put an end to this.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.290
That thing is bad news! 
Put everything you've got into blocking it!

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:49.940
Heavenly Defense: Meteorite Shield!

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:51.790
Fighting Fans: Stone Headpiece!

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:53.790
Adamantine Column...

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.800
<b>Adamantine Column:
Armor-Piercing Stream</b>

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.250
Armor-Piercing Stream.

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:08.560
I didn't expect to be forced 
to open one of my columns.

00:11:10.170 --> 00:11:13.450
Oh? And I was going to 
leave one of you alive...

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:14.560
Oh, well.

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:20.070
It's only natural that anyone who 
goes after Kukuri-chan dies for it.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:22.680
This is the end, Akito!

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:29.450
What the hell are these?!

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:31.460
Chopsticks?!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:36.560
We knew you were coming, 
so we had time to prepare.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:41.470
Mimane brought those chopsticks 
from a neighborhood restaurant.

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:45.280
They're made of iron birch,

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:47.470
also known as "axe-breaking birch."

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.470
<b>Axe-Breaking Birch</b>

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:53.100
Using the same trick that I did, huh?

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:56.730
Then I guess I'll have to hit you with 
my best move to beat your best, right?!

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:01.360
Battle-Axe...

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:05.240
God Axe Slash!

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:05.240
<b>God Axe Slash</b>

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:10.000
Great Scissors' Edge.

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:10.000
<b>Great Scissors' Edge</b>

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:26.560
And Taguri said not to destroy him...

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:27.760
It wouldn't have mattered.

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:33.080
Genbu wouldn't have given up any secrets, 
even if he was tortured until it destroyed him.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:35.520
Something's funny about this, though.

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:39.610
Didn't Genbu and the others 
know they'd be fighting you?

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:42.110
Not to mention the exorcist 
and the goddess...

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:42.960
Right.

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:45.530
Doesn't it seem like, even if they had won,

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:49.160
they wouldn't have had the 
strength to return to Mayoiga?

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:52.660
It's not as if they could use 
malison crossing like us.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:55.900
So how were they gonna bring the shard back?

00:12:58.070 --> 00:13:00.670
<i>That's it! Genbu and the 
others were a distraction!</i>

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:05.330
<i>He'll have allies that are 
targeting the regional goddess!</i>

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.180
<b>Hakusan Shrine</b>

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:11.920
Patron deity of Hakusan Shrine, 
Kukuri-hime no Kami...

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:14.680
We're here to take your life.

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:17.430
Assassins from Mayoiga.

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:19.440
Yer after my shard, huh?

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:27.300
We know that you've become so weak, you can't 
even summon water like you normally do.

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:34.090
I'll end this with one blow 
so you won't suffer.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:38.960
Death From Above: Five-Ring Shattering!

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:38.960
<b>Death From Above:
Five-Ring Shattering</b>

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:50.470
Yahoo!

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:52.470
Hey, Super Kazuya!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:54.210
I'm glad to see you're okay!

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:55.230
We can talk later!

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:58.360
There might be others attacking 
Kukuri-hime as we speak!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:01.660
<i>Kukuri-chan...</i>

00:14:17.590 --> 00:14:18.410
Impossible...

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:23.750
You're supposed to be weakened to 
the point of near-helplessness!

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:27.350
But you were able to take Rokkaku 
out in the blink of an eye?!

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:28.740
That shouldn't be possible!

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:38.240
After what you've done to 
Kokuyou, yer gonna pay.

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:43.270
Fist of the Water God!

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:48.380
She's still weakened! Let's get her!

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:49.390
Yeah!

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:50.410
Kukuri-chan!

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.280
A barrier? I can't get through!

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:55.040
Kukuri-chan!

00:15:58.220 --> 00:15:59.500
Amazing...

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:05.080
<i>She's still this strong 
after having been weakened?!</i>

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:13.030
Well, yer the last man standin' now.

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:15.030
Whaddaya say?

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:20.640
I'm not going back 
empty-handed after all this!

00:16:21.740 --> 00:16:25.290
Answer the summons of my rod, 
abominable fish of the uncanny seas!

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:27.140
{sign=}Asura Tooth!

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:29.550
<b>Asura Tooth</b>

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:47.580
<b>Fist of the Water God:
Glorious Aqua Needle</b>

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.580
Fist of the Water God: Glorious Aqua Needle!

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:52.100
The barrier...

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:54.860
The enemy must have put it up!

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:57.380
Kukuri-chan!

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:00.420
Kazuyan!

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:02.050
I guess yer okay, huh?

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:02.870
Yeah!

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:06.420
You did great, Kukuri-chan! 
That was incredible!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.880
Aw, t'weren't nothin'.

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:11.080
He's right. That really was something.

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.660
Not bad, Kukuri!

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:18.140
Kiriha-san.

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:20.330
Looks like yer okay, too, Kiriha!

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:22.140
Go ahead an' praise me!

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.820
Why'd you have to kill 
them all, you imbecile?!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:32.020
Wait, why?! Somebody else 
hadda leave one alive, right?!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:35.400
We can go over the details 
after we get back...

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:39.840
They...

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:42.700
They're all busted.

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:45.930
Now we can't ask 'em about Mayoiga!

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:47.710
You destroyed more than anyone else!

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:52.490
Wait, wasn't the flute 
tsugumomo still in one piece?

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:54.960
True enough, and yet...

00:17:56.430 --> 00:18:01.470
You're going to tell us everything 
about your comrades and Mayoiga.

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:06.730
Is she still resisting?!

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:11.980
Huh?

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:14.170
And there you have it.

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:20.490
I getcha. Guess she used up too much 
strength to maintain her tsukumogami form.

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:21.900
In that case...

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:27.500
Kazuyan's gonna need to be 
her temp partner for a bit.

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:32.090
That oughta restore enough spiritual 
power to bring her back.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:33.290
I see...

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:36.280
I hope that works.

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:42.500
Well, I don't figure there's gonna 
be any more attacks just yet.

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:45.520
Good work, people! Much appreciated!

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.270
Anything for you, Kukuri-chan!

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:52.800
You must be tired. 
Would you like to take a break?

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:54.520
Would I?!

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:00.280
In that case, Kukuri, 
let's head to the living room.

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:04.410
We can't be making a fuss around 
Kokuyou when she's sleeping.

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:06.670
Ya got a point there!

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:07.780
Clearly...

00:19:09.490 --> 00:19:10.560
Kiriha-san...

00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:17.300
I'm sorry, Kiriha-san... 
about forcing you with the command...

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:34.780
We'll go ahead and head back now.

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:37.040
Much obliged, you two!

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:41.530
Aw, I wanted to spend the night!

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:43.100
We've got bigger concerns right now.

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:44.410
Harrumph!

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:49.830
<i>For the time being, we don't have to 
worry about intel on Mayoiga leaking...</i>

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.700
<i>But we've lost even more villagers.</i>

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:57.780
<i>For now, we should head back to the 
village and report on what's happened.</i>

00:19:57.780 --> 00:19:58.820
Brother!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:01.920
Arumi?

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:04.900
There's trouble...

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:06.220
What? What is it?

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:08.220
It's Mayoiga...

00:20:08.630 --> 00:20:10.280
There's been a revolt!

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:46.440
Here we are, Kazuya-kun.

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:48.450
Wait long?

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.440
I-I'm sorry about this.

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:54.450
I always say one day without a 
bath wouldn't kill me, but...

00:21:54.690 --> 00:21:56.710
That ain't gonna do, Kazuya!

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:59.570
Bathin's like laundry for your body!

00:21:59.570 --> 00:22:03.050
Wouldn't do to fall behind, y'know?

00:22:03.850 --> 00:22:05.470
Uh, Kukuri-chan...

00:22:06.610 --> 00:22:10.000
What about a blindfold? 
Because I'll see everything otherwise.

00:22:11.460 --> 00:22:13.010
Don't sweat it, now!

00:22:14.780 --> 00:22:16.790
Come on, it's time to get ya clean!

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:18.600
What's gotten into you, Kukuri-chan?

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:24.210
Oh, the celebratory party got 
a little bit out of hand.

00:22:23.420 --> 00:22:25.610
<b>Ahahahaha</b>

00:22:24.750 --> 00:22:25.610
A <i>little</i> bit?!

00:22:25.610 --> 00:22:28.370
Come on, snap out of it, Kukuri-chan!

00:22:29.150 --> 00:22:33.620
If I go like this, we both get clean together! 
Two birds with one stone!

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:35.800
Kukuri-chan is cute even when she's smashed!

00:22:35.800 --> 00:22:36.960
Why are you filming this?!

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:38.130
For a permanent record.

00:22:38.130 --> 00:22:39.620
Neither of us want that!

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.090
I heard all about it, Kazuyan...

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:46.340
Why you used Divine Possession.

00:22:45.880 --> 00:22:51.890
\hHer Imagination\h

00:22:45.880 --> 00:22:51.890
\hHer Imagination\h

00:22:46.340 --> 00:22:50.270
Ya got all fired up over 
Kokuyou on my behalf, huh?

00:22:47.450 --> 00:22:50.270
How dare you hurt Kukuri-chan?!

00:22:50.270 --> 00:22:51.890
W-Well, kind of...

00:22:52.170 --> 00:22:55.520
So this is just me showin' my gratitude!

00:22:58.260 --> 00:23:02.040
I'm startin' to feel light-headed... 
and it's kinda nice...

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:03.400
Kanayama-san, help!

00:23:04.990 --> 00:23:05.930
That'll be 20,000 yen.

00:23:05.930 --> 00:23:06.900
You're charging?!

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:11.000
I can take it from there. 
Come on, Kukuri-chan.

00:23:14.460 --> 00:23:15.780
Oh, come on!

00:23:15.780 --> 00:23:18.220
Well, it's a good thing we're in the bath!

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:32.930
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:20.230 --> 00:23:22.150
With the regional goddess under 
attack, it's an emergency!

00:23:22.150 --> 00:23:24.930
And in preparation for the next battle, 
the Kagami household gets help from...

00:23:24.930 --> 00:23:26.050
Sunao-san?!

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:29.880
Meanwhile, the revolt in Mayoiga 
leads to a final decision...

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:32.930
Next time on <i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>, 
Chapter 10: "Revolt."

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:32.930
<b>Revolt</b>

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:33.900
Don't miss it!

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:34.930
<b>Don't miss it!</b>

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:40.250
